# NOTE: FLAC/MP3 decoding is not compiled in. The upstream implementation
# sources were dropped in the v4.9.5 CRAN slimming (only headers remain under
# praat.github.io/external/{flac,mp3}), so flac_stubs.cpp is linked instead and
# Sound() falls back to the 'av' package for those formats. The former
# FLAC_SRC/MP3_SRC variables were dead: they named a praat/ prefix that no
# longer exists and were never referenced by SOURCES.

